0"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u5c4f2025-11-22 00.17.36.png", "id": "1209406691045296", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618069_1209406697711962_6731899338958861177_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fMrAL4lstGQQ7kNvwHt_BdJ&_nc_oc=Adr-mAUc9KBGJV0UB4tehkj_JOu20QW3iz1_l_xFti3DmOupM6p6yfvmzBeVuVWmFFE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9mU5n1lUrlUtVTdnYl1mQgh_Q7oMBhwKUHFDaVZaKbcA&oe=6A3D4713"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "122.png", "id": "2048846992581670", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_2048846995915003_2220623875527525150_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yvy2jA5Yd18Q7kNvwHsAgBN&_nc_oc=AdoxTKZbAOSjsdKv1dKDLy5wNA3UTIqeSc5AgcQ5UuMa0tU4k5IOZ036vfujTT6zUR4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-YOPKGJvdrXTlES-jpGyfR3p0C1WWOGGVLgvPTnm8WUQ&oe=6A3D3391"}, "display_name": "Mini Golf Mania: Mixed Reality Mini Golf", "keywords": ["golf", "minigolf", "sports", "MR", "sandbox"], "long_description": "Hey mini-golf enthusiasts, listen up! Dive into a whole new dimension of putting action with Mini Golf Mania (MGM for short) \u2014 this ultimate Mixed Reality (MR) mini-golf game is redefining the joy of mini-golf putting.\n\n**Mini-Golf x Mixed Reality = The Ultimate At-Home Entertainment Combo**\nMini Golf Mania pioneers the world of MR mini-golf: transform your living room or bedroom into a personalized course. No more worrying about the weather or wasting time on travel \u2014 as rich course challenges unfold naturally in your home space, you can enjoy MR mini-golf fun while watching TV, taking care of pets, or keeping an eye on the kids.\n\n**Sandbox Mode x Rich Module Themes = Build Your Own Course (BYOC)**\nWith Mini Golf Mania\u2019s \"Sandbox Editor,\" you can craft the mini-golf levels of your dreams. Use straight paths, ramps, looped tracks, and a wide variety of level modules, paired with multiple themed decorations \u2014 not only can you showcase your genius design skills, but you can also put mini-golf lovers around the globe to the test with these custom maps.\n\n**Massive Maps x Flexible, Fun Gameplay = Endless Unique Level Challenges**\nMini Golf Mania boasts a huge library of vibrant, themed maps that are regularly updated. You can freely combine smaller maps to create an infinite number of brand-new levels. A roguelike mode will also be added to the game in the future. Say goodbye to boring fixed courses for good \u2014 every round is a fresh, thrilling adventure.\n\nIf you love mini-golf, Mini ", "short_description": "Hey mini-golf enthusiasts, listen up! Dive into a whole new dimension of putting action with Mini Golf Mania (MGM for short) \u2014 this ultimate Mixed Reality (MR) mini-golf game is redefining the joy of mini-golf putting."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skycamp-studio.github.io/Home/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skycamp Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://skycamp-studio.github.io/Home/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US", "en_AU", "en_CA", "en_ZA", "en_GB", "zh_CN", "zh_HK", "zh_TW", "ja", "fr_BE", "fr_CA", "fr", "de", "de_CH", "gsw", "it", "es_AR", "es_CL", "es_CO", "es_MX", "es_PE", "es_PR", "es", "es_VE", "pt_BR", "pt", "ru", "ru_UA", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_playe